    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43164" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑτερο-κρᾱνία</span></b> , ἡ,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>pain on one side of the
				head</i> (cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡμικρανία</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Archig.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				8.94
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aret.
				<u>CD</u>
				1.2
			</span></i>, etc. (also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑτερο-κράνιον</span></b> , τό, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				14.400
			</span></i>). Adj.
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑτερο-κρᾱνικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>,
				<i>liable to such pain</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Antyll.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				10.19.1
			</span></i>.</div>
